Build output lives outside the tree (see build/env.sh, MK_BUILD).
The entries below are symlinks created by build/mksandbox.sh that point
at $MK_BUILD or at the ode4linux clone. The build writes through them,
so nothing lands inside the repository.
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/obj
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/export/at386
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/src/makedefs/sys.mk
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/src/makedefs/osf.man.mk
/osfmk7.3/osfmk/src/makedefs/osf.doc.mk
/obj/
/export/
*.o
*.pp
